{
  "name": "Daily FMCSA Commercial Trucking Insurance Gap & BMC-91X Alert (Apify 3-Table Socrata Join -> Sheets + Slack)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🚛 FMCSA Commercial Trucking Insurance Gap Alert (3-Table Federal Join)\n**Why this workflow beats single-table DOT scrapers:**\nStandard FMCSA scrapers only read `az4n-8mr2` (Census) or single DOT lookups without live `BMC-91X` insurance history. This workflow calls the **US FMCSA Insurance Gap, Permits & New LLC Signal Engine** Apify Actor (`$4.50 / 1,000 verified leads` PPE), which cross-joins 3 live federal Socrata tables:\n1. `x96h-evps` (FMCSA Insurance History - BMC-91X filings)\n2. `inys-ebih` (Carrier Registrations - Operating Authority & BIPD on file)\n3. `az4n-8mr2` (Company Census - 100% Verified Phone & Fleet Size)\n\n### ⚙️ 60-Second Setup (Reviewer-Safe Header Auth)\n1. Create a **Header Auth** credential in n8n: Header Name = `Authorization`, Value = `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN`.\n2. Attach that credential to node **2. Run Apify FMCSA Signal Engine**.\n3. Connect your **Google Sheets** & **Slack** credentials. The **IF node** automatically routes `CRITICAL_BIPD_ZERO` ($0 liability on file while active) to Slack while logging all 100% phone-verified carriers to Google Sheets.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b101a001-1111-4111-8111-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup & Architecture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 7 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "b101a001-1111-4111-8111-000000000002",
      "name": "1. Weekday 7AM EST Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/pipeforge~us-socrata-b2b-signal-crossjoin-engine/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"mode\": \"fmcsa_crossjoin\",\n  \"limit\": 25,\n  \"onlyCriticalBipdZero\": false\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "b101a001-1111-4111-8111-000000000003",
      "name": "2. Run Apify FMCSA Signal Engine",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-crit-bipd-zero",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.signal_priority }}",
              "rightValue": "CRITICAL_BIPD_ZERO",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b101a001-1111-4111-8111-000000000004",
      "name": "3. IF CRITICAL_BIPD_ZERO",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        680,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "FMCSA_Daily_Leads",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "signal_priority": "={{ $json.signal_priority }}",
            "trans_date": "={{ $json.trans_date }}",
            "effective_date": "={{ $json.effective_date }}",
            "ins_form_code": "={{ $json.ins_form_code }}",
            "docket_number": "={{ $json.docket_number }}",
            "usdot_number": "={{ $json.usdot_number }}",
            "legal_name": "={{ $json.legal_name }}",
            "phone_formatted": "={{ $json.phone_formatted }}",
            "bus_street_po": "={{ $json.bus_street_po }}",
            "bus_city": "={{ $json.bus_city }}",
            "bus_state_code": "={{ $json.bus_state_code }}",
            "bus_zip_code": "={{ $json.bus_zip_code }}",
            "op_auth_status": "={{ $json.op_auth_status }}",
            "bipd_file": "={{ $json.bipd_file }}",
            "max_cov_amount": "={{ $json.max_cov_amount }}",
            "policy_no": "={{ $json.policy_no }}",
            "power_units": "={{ $json.power_units }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b101a001-1111-4111-8111-000000000005",
      "name": "4A. Log All Verified FMCSA Leads to Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        960,
        600
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "text": "=:rotating_light: *CRITICAL FMCSA BIPD=$0 INSURANCE GAP DETECTED*\n*Carrier:* {{ $json.legal_name }} (`{{ $json.docket_number }}` / USDOT `{{ $json.usdot_number }}`)\n*Direct Verified Phone:* `{{ $json.phone_formatted }}`\n*Location:* {{ $json.bus_street_po }}, {{ $json.bus_city }}, {{ $json.bus_state_code }} {{ $json.bus_zip_code }}\n*Operating Authority:* `{{ $json.op_auth_status }}` | *BIPD on File:* `${{ $json.bipd_file }}` | *Required Policy Max:* `${{ $json.max_cov_amount }}`\n*Fleet Size:* {{ $json.power_units }} Power Unit(s) | *Form:* {{ $json.ins_form_code }} (Eff: {{ $json.effective_date }})",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "b101a001-1111-4111-8111-000000000006",
      "name": "4B. Slack Alert: Immediate Broker Dial",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        360
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "1. Weekday 7AM EST Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "2. Run Apify FMCSA Signal Engine",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "2. Run Apify FMCSA Signal Engine": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "3. IF CRITICAL_BIPD_ZERO",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "3. IF CRITICAL_BIPD_ZERO": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "4B. Slack Alert: Immediate Broker Dial",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "4A. Log All Verified FMCSA Leads to Google Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "4A. Log All Verified FMCSA Leads to Google Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
